@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

map "R1 Response Format (1 byte)" as R1 {
  Bit 7 => 0 (always zero)
  Bit 6 => parameter error
  Bit 5 => address error
  Bit 4 => erase sequence error
  Bit 3 => com crc error
  Bit 2 => illegal command
  Bit 1 => erase reset
  Bit 0 => in idle state
}

note bottom of R1
  MSB (bit 7) is always 0
  Bits 6-0 are error/status flags
  A set bit (1) indicates the condition
end note
@enduml